# Build context hygiene. Without this, node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes shipped to the
# daemon on every build, and config/application-local.yml — which holds real credentials — would be
# copied into an image layer.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.angular

# Never build a secret into an image. This file is gitignored for the same reason.
portal-server/config/application-local.yml
.env

.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.claude
.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Documentation and marketing assets are not needed to build or run the server.
docs
assets
README.md
**/README.md
